# Tour level 6, Civic Center (data/tour.json), a 2-minute run from UN Plaza: its three goals, the tape
# and S-K-A-T-E, each set up with a teleport.
# - UN Plaza's north row at 7.2 m/s, coming in at a slant: a 50-50 on a ledge, popped off its end onto
#   the next, three of them (S on the third): UN Plaza Line (2,500 with a UN PLAZA LEDGE, started in the
#   plaza). Phase 26: a decent player makes this line half the time by feel --tour, the old one (6 m/s,
#   straight along the row) a quarter.
# - In the sunken fountain, a boneless from the floor onto the tallest pier: the tape.
# - The fountain's rim on the Market side, K on it, popped off: BS 50-50 + FOUNTAIN RIM, 1,936.
# - Civic Center Plaza, the ledge round the lawns at the north-west corner: T on it, 1,726.
# - The F-line rails on UN Plaza's piece of Market near 8th, a 50-50 ridden 25 m down it (A on the way):
#   F-Line Grind; it stalls after 10 s, 4,856.
# - City Hall: the hubba down the north cheek wall of the Polk St steps, 1,700; then off the porch and
#   down all the steps, E in the air over them: City Hall Steps.
park sf
cmd 0 traffic clear
cmd 0 run level civic
bot balance
cmd 1 teleport 262.44 406.49 0.4 74.5
cmd 3 set skater.vel.x 6.9646
cmd 3 set skater.vel.y 1.9373
hold ollie 4..12
hold ollie 65..108
hold ollie 197..300
tap grind 14
tap grind 19..62 every 6
tap grind 109..194 every 6
tap grind 301..374 every 6
cmd 902 teleport 411.6 441.3 -2.9 42.8
cmd 912 set skater.vel.x 2.039
cmd 912 set skater.vel.y 2.201
hold ollie 920..1000
tap up 986
tap up 993
cmd 1402 teleport 405.85 427.13 -2.02 27.4
cmd 1404 set skater.vel.x 2.2641
cmd 1404 set skater.vel.y 4.3680
hold ollie 1428..1443
tap grind 1445..1485 every 6
hold ollie 1730..1760
cmd 2000 teleport 70.56 432.94 3.6 172.4
cmd 2002 set skater.vel.x 0.6143
cmd 2002 set skater.vel.y -4.6395
hold ollie 2000..2020
tap grind 2022..2355 every 6
cmd 2502 teleport 288.50 272.49 0.14 45.1
cmd 2504 set skater.vel.x 3.546
cmd 2504 set skater.vel.y 3.525
hold ollie 2512..2522
tap grind 2528
cmd 4002 teleport 9.84 362.53 5.78 49.3
cmd 4004 set skater.vel.x 3.6390
cmd 4004 set skater.vel.y 3.1301
hold ollie 4022..4034
tap grind 4036..4060 every 6
cmd 4400 teleport 11.3 354.3 5.78 81.2
cmd 4402 set skater.vel.x 6.424
cmd 4402 set skater.vel.y 0.9945
hold ollie 4403..4411
run 14700
expect event levelStart{level=civic,seconds=120} within 0..2
expect event comboLanded{name=BS 50-50 + UN PLAZA LEDGE + FS 50-50 + BS 50-50,points=3196} within 590..590
expect event levelGoal{level=civic,id=unline,name=UN Plaza Line} within 590..590
expect event letter{letter=S,have=S____} within 428..428
expect event tapeFound{level=civic} within 1097..1101
expect event letter{letter=K,have=SK___} within 1715..1719
expect event gap{id=fountain_rim,points=400} within 1759..1763
expect event letter{letter=T,have=SK_T_} within 2095..2099
expect event gap{id=civic_ledge,points=200} within 2359..2363
expect event letter{letter=A,have=SKAT_} within 2741..2745
expect event levelGoal{level=civic,id=fline,name=F-Line Grind} within 3555..3559
expect event gap{id=city_hall_hubba,points=500} within 4200..4204
expect event letter{letter=E,have=SKATE} within 4446..4450
expect event levelGoal{level=civic,id=skate} within 4446..4450
expect event levelGoal{level=civic,id=steps,name=City Hall Steps} within 4546..4550
expect event levelOver{level=civic,score=14268,tape=true} within 14399..14402
expect session.levelGoals.length == 6 at end
expect no event levelWrongWay
expect no event bail
